---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="About ALVOCOR LLC"
    description="Learn about ALVOCOR LLC, a technology consulting firm specializing in enterprise .NET development, full-stack applications, API integration, cloud solutions, workflow automation, modernization, and AI-assisted software development."
    canonicalPath="/About"
>
    <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-9">
                    <div class="eyebrow mb-3">About ALVOCOR LLC</div>
                    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">
                        Technology consulting built around real business needs.
                    </h1>
                    <p class="lead mb-0">
                        ALVOCOR LLC helps organizations develop, modernize,
                        integrate, and automate software solutions through
                        practical engineering, thoughtful architecture, and
                        reliable implementation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-white">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-5 align-items-start">
                <div class="col-lg-7">
                    <div class="section-kicker">Who We Are</div>
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        Engineering expertise. Practical solutions. Lasting value.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-text">
                        ALVOCOR LLC is a technology consulting firm focused on
                        helping businesses solve complex technical challenges
                        and build dependable software systems. The company
                        combines hands-on engineering with a practical
                        approach to architecture, integration, and delivery.
                    </p>
                    <p class="section-text">
                        Areas of expertise include enterprise .NET development,
                        full-stack application engineering, API design and
                        integration, SQL Server-backed systems, cloud
                        solutions, workflow automation, and legacy system
                        modernization.
                    </p>
                    <p class="section-text">
                        ALVOCOR LLC also explores AI-assisted development and
                        intelligent automation to improve engineering
                        efficiency, streamline business processes, and create
                        new opportunities for innovation.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-5">
                    <div class="mission-panel p-4 p-lg-5">
                        <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Our Core Principles</h3>
                        <ul class="check-list mb-0">
                            <li>
                                <strong>Practical engineering.</strong>
                                Deliver solutions that address real business
                                requirements.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Maintainable architecture.</strong>
                                Build software that can evolve with changing
                                needs.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Thoughtful modernization.</strong>
                                Improve existing systems while managing
                                complexity and risk.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Purposeful innovation.</strong>
                                Apply cloud technologies, AI, and automation
                                where they provide measurable value.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Transparent collaboration.</strong>
                                Communicate technical decisions, tradeoffs,
                                and priorities clearly.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="section-kicker">Our Approach</div>
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        Senior-level technical thinking without unnecessary
                        complexity.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-text">
                        Every engagement is approached with an emphasis on
                        clarity, technical quality, and measurable outcomes.
                        From developing new applications to improving existing
                        platforms, ALVOCOR LLC provides focused consulting and
                        implementation support tailored to each project's
                        objectives.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="mission-panel p-4 p-lg-5">
                        <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Areas of Focus</h3>
                        <ul class="check-list mb-0">
                            <li>Custom software development</li>
                            <li>Enterprise application modernization</li>
                            <li>API and system integration</li>
                            <li>Cloud and workflow automation</li>
                            <li>AI-assisted engineering</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>